        "cooked": "<p>All I know is playing Hidden Mine on turn 1 will end up nuking Fright Train. But I’m also not sure you want to do that? My first attempt was a slog that crawled to inevitable defeat, so I’m not sure what I could have done better. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/confused.png?v=9\" title=\":confused:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":confused:\"></p>",
